        "applicantEligibilityDesc": "Applicants must also meet the following requirements to be eligible to apply to this NOFO:\r\n&bull;\tExperience in Lebanon or similar Middle Eastern country that routinely deals with conflict.\r\n&bull;\tAt least 5 years&rsquo; experience working with a judicial system to document and digitize criminal or other case files.\r\n&bull;\tSuccessfully digitized court case files for a non-U.S. partner government.",
